### Ejecuta authLogin una vez en este archivo para obtener un token sin copiarlo.
@accessToken = {{authLogin.response.body.$.access_token}}

# @name authLogin
POST {{apiUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "{{authUsername}}",
  "password": "{{authPassword}}"
}

### Actualizar pasajero (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/pasajeros/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria Garcia Actualizada",
  "address": "Calle 20 # 10-50",
  "phone": "3009876543",
  "email": "maria.updated@example.com",
  "password": "NewPassword123!",
  "status": "active"
}

###

### Actualizar pasajero parcial (PATCH)
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/pasajeros/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "3111111111"
}
